ath></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Plotting these points, we obtain the following curve:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-97165d22b73d4802b0c23ebcecf504d1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/97165d22b73d4802b0c23ebcecf504d1\"></div></div></div>",
